  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/wJsScE9BrQA?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/asfPpXCKcMI?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1d52825a-2287-0d67-c6c6-56ae64cbb9db.jpeg\" width=\"612\" alt=\"RedandGreenIllustratedRetailHolidaySaleInstagramPostInstagramPost45_2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><strong><span><span>The Brew Shop Beer Advent Calendar</span></span></strong><span><span> pre-sales are live! Get it while you can as quantities are getting low!</span></span><span><span><span> Inside our festive box, you'll find 24 beers to carry you through the first 24 days of December. </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Available in limited quantities and by pre-order only</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, make sure you grab your box before they sell out!</span></span></span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/CkOSoKSsYiS?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MORE DETAILS AND PRE-ORDER ADVENT CALENDAR HERE!</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/a6d86ccb-5fb5-7368-5064-4d6fe85f505c.png\" width=\"612\" alt=\"Grid45WeeklyTasting_3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Bear Chase&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! Scroll down to the bottom of our newsletter to see the full line-up for this month!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/ca8d109d-6b5f-ea86-df3c-53371fc554b4.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>👊 It’s time....</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>the Alchemist Heady Topper</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> is back!</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/a0d0f6df-43d9-9b60-dbb2-5589564e36c1.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>✨ Feeling hoppy with </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Grimm</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Mating Dance</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> IPA with Mosaic, Strata &amp; Nelson Sauvin<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Bang</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> DIPA with Nectaron, Strata &amp; Simcoe</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/87a11023-70f7-248a-afcf-6b6650622ead.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🧠 Fresh drop from </sp